out.push(A('⚠ **This is the stage where the band-1 slip is really taught, and it is taught by stopping people.** **Every reading is flat, at ordinary speed, with nothing added.** **The commentary will come** — _which is quite common_, _that is about speed_, _I have the same one_ — **and each time it does, ask the room one question: whose line is it, and are they here?** **Three or four stoppages and it ends.** **Then the point: the room has just done, out loud, the thing the slip asks for in writing** — **reading a document as the reader it was written for and not as a classmate.**'));
