out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('⚠ **Listen for the rise, and name it the first time it happens.** **A figure about your own work said with the voice going up is a figure offered for agreement, and the room will supply the agreement.** **_Four times._ Down, and stop.** **Then wait.** **The silence after a flat figure is about two seconds long and almost everybody fills it** — _which is quite a lot, I suppose_ — **and that filling is the rise arriving by another route.** **Three or four goes and it stops.** **The habit is worth the time: it is the one in this unit a student will use in an interview in Book 2, Unit 13.**'));
out.push(S('Homework (sample)'));
