  '**THE NOTE** _(for myself)_   **Four sentences came out and one came in.** ⚠ **The one that came in is the uninitialled amendment**, which is the fact the no-conclusion sentence had been standing in front of. **None of the four that went contained a figure or a date.** **All four told the reader I was being fair, and draft two says it by naming the thing I cannot prove.**',
