out.push(A('⚠ **Count the gap-fillers aloud and write them on the board.** **_So_ · _of course_ · _as I say_ · _obviously_ · _well_** — **two or three per reader, and always from that handful.** **Then the sentence of the cycle: those are the removed sentences coming back through the mouth.** **A reader who leaves the gaps alone is reading a C1 page; a reader who fills them is restoring the scaffolding out loud.** ⚠ **And one last thing to say here and not later: nobody is being told that three books of this course were badly written.** **They were written to be seen.** **This cycle is where the class is told so, by one of their own, and 1.7 is where they have to say it to somebody else.**'));
