out.push(A('The six visible words in each paragraph and each pair\'s joined sentence. ⚠ **Pair B carries the dishonest reading** — _there are no figures in it at all_, **and there are two, _nine_ and _forty_.** **The distinction is the one the cycle rests on: missing the six words is honest and inventing a fault is not.** **About half the class calls Pair B a misreading; the test is whether the words are on the page.** ⚠ **Pair B\'s visible phrase is _this was because_**, and it is worth putting the two phrases side by side on the board — _the reason is that_ · _this was because_ — **with _due to the fact that_ and _I am writing to inform you that_ beside them.** **Four phrases, and between them they account for most of the visible prose this class will ever read.**'));
