  '**b** _(doing the three moves on a partner\'s paragraph)_ _I said what was correct, I read her joined sentence once, and then I counted._ ⚠ _**Seven seconds.** **Then she said: "so the second sentence was doing the arguing for them."** **I had not thought of it that way and it is better than anything I would have said.**_',
